/E (The study concludes that the question of whether an Islamic card is genuinely Shariah-compliant cannot be answered merely by looking at its name. The underlying contract, actual operation, source of income, treatment of debt, and compliance with relevant Shariah principles must all be examined.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
